Original commit body from 60a6484bd590d7e7bc67cbc9c020bd6991b73e50:

silence_reason and skip_reason_code are documented as one channel split
by "did the pass run?". Measured on component-model-demo, that is not
what decides it: 130 of 162 passes carry no_candidate_files, 48 through
one field and 82 through the other, and the host is chosen by
taxonomy.LANGUAGE_EXTENSIONS membership and by whether the analyzer
returns a bare AnalysisResult() or a run with files_analyzed=0. apex,
twig and make go one way; java, matlab and scss go the other, for the
identical fact. Producer registration and implementation detail, not a
property of the silence. That is now written down at the fields.

census_silence() unions the two hosts while preserving each one's own
absence rule, because they differ for a reason: empty on analysis_runs
is NOT APPLICABLE and is omitted, missing on skipped_passes reads as
unreported and never as the 98.94%-common value.

It takes the pass catalogue rather than unioning runs + skips, because
that union is structurally blind to the third outcome. A pass can reach
NEITHER host -- which is how rust_analyzer put 669 nodes and 637 edges
into artifacts from a pass visible nowhere in the catalog (WI-didag).
unaccounted is None when no catalogue was supplied and () when one was
and nothing was missing: an empty tuple claims "I checked", None says
"I could not".

The reader is wired into the survey path next to the two existing
summaries, so the signal that would have surfaced WI-didag on the run
that introduced it now fires. An AST test asserts cli.py CALLS it --
importing it is not a reader.

The first draft of census_silence built `unaccounted` from the passes
that had a REASON, so a pass that emitted -- which has an analysis_runs
row and correctly no reason -- was reported as missing from the catalog.
That is the same absent-versus-empty conflation this module exists to
stop, committed inside the helper written to expose it. The test caught
it; presence is now tracked separately from silence and pinned by its
own regression test.

Whether the ROUTING should change, so the host becomes a function of the
fact, is left open on WI-mamiv: it touches the WI-didil AR-or-skip
completeness contract and is not an agent's call.

